    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Desk Garden&quot; is a soothing desktop idle game that quietly grows in the corner of your screen while you work or study. Freely arrange your plants anywhere on screen - they'll never interrupt your productivity.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meet your quirky plant babies! From shy little sprouts to chatty humanoid blossoms, your Tiny Island blooms with personality. Each adorable plant grows with its own unique charm!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575790/extras/b590d150e11cfcb9a994d1be532b3123.poster.avif?t=1750210868\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575790/extras/b590d150e11cfcb9a994d1be532b3123.webm?t=1750210868\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575790/extras/b590d150e11cfcb9a994d1be532b3123.mp4?t=1750210868\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every mystery plant box brings a new surprise!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575790/extras/5bc2cc2723813ed9e094308d4ee561b9.poster.avif?t=1750210868\" width=800 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575790/extras/5bc2cc2723813ed9e094308d4ee561b9.webm?t=1750210868\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575790/extras/5bc2cc2723813ed9e094308d4ee561b9.mp4?t=1750210868\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover a world of surprises with our decorative mystery boxes!</strong> Plus, enjoy soothing background music to accompany your work and study sessions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575790/extras/ac61ba16c21e566ebb90e7de9e0318df.poster.avif?t=1750210868\" width=800 height=208 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575790/extras/ac61ba16c21e566ebb90e7de9e0318df.webm?t=1750210868\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575790/extras/ac61ba16c21e566ebb90e7de9e0318df.mp4?t=1750210868\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575790/extras/532d117314913c0863f65d061321ccb5.poster.avif?t=1750210868\" width=800 height=208 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575790/extras/532d117314913c0863f65d061321ccb5.webm?t=1750210868\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575790/extras/532d117314913c0863f65d061321ccb5.mp4?t=1750210868\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>",
